{"availability":"available","full":"AndreaBozzo/Ceres","name":"Ceres","description":"Harvest open data portal metadata into PostgreSQL with incremental sync. Rust CLI, REST API, Parquet snapshots.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Rust","stars":14,"forks":4,"created":"2025-11-29T14:26:26Z","updated":"2026-10-09T13:04:28Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://learnceres.pages.dev","topics":["ckan","cli","data-catalog","data-engineering","dcat","harvester","metadata","open-data","open-government-data","parquet","postgresql","rust"],"demo":"https://learnceres.pages.dev/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T15:35:37.294Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T15:35:37.294Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T15:35:37.294Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T14:47:24.862Z","stars":13,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-09T15:35:37.294Z","stars":14,"forks":4}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Harvest open data portal metadata into one PostgreSQL catalog.","Website · Supported portals · Harvesting · REST API · Open Data Index","Ceres reads dataset metadata from open data portals and keeps it in sync in PostgreSQL: incremental fetches, stale marking instead of deletion, and bounded memory on catalogs with millions of records. It speaks ten portal APIs: CKAN, DCAT (udata REST and SPARQL), Project Open Data data.json, Socrata, OpenDataSoft, ArcGIS Hub, OGC CSW, STAC and SDMX."],"features":["Harvesting never waits on embeddings. The metadata path runs with no provider configured.","Partial runs say so. A catalog read only in part is recorded as partial, and a batch with failed portals exits with code 2.","Removals are kept. Datasets that disappear from a portal are marked stale, not deleted.","Source metadata is kept whole. Normalized resources sit next to the raw portal record.","Snapshots are verifiable. Every Parquet file has a SHA-256 checksum in the manifest."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AndreaBozzo/Ceres/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"b65ab4bb7dd12d02e49ff5862b0022bccb37a9fbe94d13549fa78fdeb4a9ddea","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T01:11:27.306Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T01:11:27.306Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Harvest open data portal metadata into one PostgreSQL catalog.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AndreaBozzo/Ceres/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Building a catalog needs no API key and no GPU.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AndreaBozzo/Ceres/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"b65ab4bb7dd12d02e49ff5862b0022bccb37a9fbe94d13549fa78fdeb4a9ddea","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AndreaBozzo/Ceres/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T01:11:27.306Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T13:04:28Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AndreaBozzo/Ceres/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T01:11:27.306Z","hash":"b65ab4bb7dd12d02e49ff5862b0022bccb37a9fbe94d13549fa78fdeb4a9ddea","originalBytes":5146,"storedBytes":5146,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["ceres","portals","run","portal","data","harvest","open","rest","api","bin","cargo","metadata","catalog","harvesting","index","license","code","dataset","each","parquet","portals.toml","provider","runs","search","snapshots","type","agents.md","apache-2.0","bash","batch","change","changelog","ckan","claude","date","docker","embedding","embeddings","every","examples","face","hugging","metadata-only","ollama","opendatasoft","partial","postgresql","record.","same","scheduled","security","snapshot","stale","supported","sync","after","against","agent","apis","arcgis","between","block","bounded","building","cap","catalog.","catalogs","ceres-discovery-agent","ceres-server","changelog.md","checksum","checksummed","clone","cloud","codes","compares","compose","configured.","container","contract","contributing","contributing.md","costs","count","coverage","cov